, "period": "month", "rank": 78, "date": "2026-04-27"}], "images": {"main": "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_main.jpg", "thumb": "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_main_240x240.jpg", "samples": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp1.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp2.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp3.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp4.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp5.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp6.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp7.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp8.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp9.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp10.jpg"], "sample_thumbs": ["https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp1_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp2_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp3_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp4_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp5_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp6_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp7_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp8_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp9_100x100.jpg", "https://img.dlsite.jp/resize/images2/work/doujin/RJ01527000/RJ01526597_img_smp10_100x100.jpg"], "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}, "introductions": [{"type": "image", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR", "body": [{"intro": "Hello!<br />\n<br />\nGoing To The Caves NTR is an adventure game where your choices affect the outcome of events. <br />\nWhile traveling through the caves of the world of Auria, you'll be able to peek at Asuka through cracks, complete dungeons, fall into traps, as well as relax in the sauna and run through the maze!<br />\n<br />\nOver 20 main CGs and many additional images await you!<br />\n<br />\nA light story and diverse content! If you're ready, then Going To The Caves NTR is waiting for you!<br />\n<br />\nCaution! Poorly working on Android!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/bc22c678e54dc748319daecf40ce4741.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}, "position": "under"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Main characters:", "body": [{"intro": "Takahiro - the player character<br />\r\nTekumi - companion and friend<br />\r\nAsuka - Takahiro’s wife<br />\r\nSadao - the guide through the cave system<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThey travel toward a town known for its mysterious cave, where people discover unusual artifacts and rare opportunities. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, their encounter with Sadao changes their path, leading them to the depths of the cave and its hidden secrets.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/e73a6f7e49ff1b0ecd6e191e9863a4d3.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "Random Events", "body": [{"intro": "During your journey, you will come across various events... both bad and good!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/e14335e8e58964aea495081e764934ca.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}, "position": "over"}]}, {"type": "image_list", "title": "Locations and Interface!", "body": [{"intro": "The game features 4 main regions to explore, plus various dungeons and other unique spots!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/a34b227df4372738a6ffbcee31819ece.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "Many situations require you to act! And a bit of luck helps too.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNTR is avoidable... but it's hard to pull off! Asuka's feelings toward you can also worsen!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd if that happens, you might lose control over your decisions!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/a57ebaea12d694f71505f1165f10c7b9.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "A user-friendly interface for checking Asuka's status and your inventory! Easy to use and interact with!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/1206477729e1eb645515ab8b3634ea67.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "A shop with only the essentials items, and the game is free of useless junk!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/d689d5e6c017727eca73625e7923e4dc.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}]}, {"type": "image_list", "title": "Story and Dungeons!", "body": [{"intro": "4 different endings await you, and one of them is the true ending!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOver 20-25 main story sex scenes, plus a ton of other 18+ artwork.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLots of dialogue and choices that affect your actions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPeeping and suspicions galore!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/429cfc1dc1c505f95204e0ee6a135421.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "Separation dungeons, where the player temporarily progresses alone while observing Asuka’s condition through random events and environmental details.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn both cases, the results depend on character parameters and the choices made.", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/fb03673655cd63920c0b04fa2b1949a9.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "A light combat system where you must make strategic choices... sometimes not in your favor!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAlso includes Asuka's training system!", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/c948f90a4b067ed44c3a17995b2fb479.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}, {"intro": "Asuka's Will is an important stat. Many 18+ moments depend on it. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCan she resist Sadao's advances... or will she give in for the greater good?", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/9a6c6bfa2417ce8a202ecd3d5a0ad8bf.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}}]}, {"type": "image", "title": "There's plenty to do in the game.", "body": [{"intro": "The main story has its own mini-trials. You can also find a mini-boss in the sauna, and beating it will require Takahiro's strength!<br />\n<br />\nThis is my first game, and its development is a challenging but meaningful journey. <br />\n<br />\nI'm hope the game will captivate you and inspire multiple playthroughs thanks to its branching paths, randomization, and scenario variety.<br />\n<br />\nCaution! Poorly working on Android! (joyplay too)<br />\n<br />\nWith respect,<br />\nLord_Kisagaki", "image_info": {"url": "//img.dlsite.jp/modpub/images2/parts/RJ01527000/RJ01526597/03565ce9086d032d78d0550731f864d6.jpg", "alt": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]", "title": "Going To The Caves NTR [Lord_Kisagaki]"}, "position": "over"}]}], "description": "A loving couple and their friend journey across the land in searching for opportunity. But will they find a happy ending? The tale of Takahiro and Asuka... starts now!", "short_introduction": "A loving couple and their friend journey across the land in searching for opportunity. But will they find a happy ending? The tale of Takahiro and Asuka... starts now!", "url": "https://www.dlsite.com/maniax/work/=/product_id/RJ01526597.html", "site_id": "maniax", "fetched_at": 1794944550}